三、不在上述许可范围内的内容
3. Content not covered by the above

   (a) 黎曼原稿扫描/ 中的 Riemann 1859 年论文扫描本（1876 年文集版）属于
       公有领域，不受本许可约束；出处见该目录的 README。
       The scan of Riemann's 1859 paper in 黎曼原稿扫描/ (1876 Collected
       Works edition) is in the public domain and is not covered by this
       license; see the README in that directory for its source.
   (b) docs/同行审阅/ 中的预印版同行审阅稿为书稿本身，保留所有权利，
       仅供受邀审阅者阅读，不得转载或传播。
       The peer-review preprint in docs/同行审阅/ is the manuscript of the
       book itself. All rights reserved; it is provided to invited reviewers
       only and may not be redistributed.
   (c) 书籍正文（含第 21 章中译稿）的版权不因本仓库的许可而转让。
       Copyright in the book itself (including the Chinese translation in
       Chapter 21) is not licensed by this repository.
   (d) docs/同行审阅/pdfjs/ 为第三方 PDF.js 组件，适用其附带的
       Apache License 2.0 及字体等资源的原始许可，详见该目录的 LICENSE 与 NOTICE.md。
       The third-party PDF.js distribution retains its bundled Apache 2.0
       and resource licenses; see its LICENSE and NOTICE.md.

